    "body": "I have dug a bit in the history. The \"HTML fragment serialisation algorithm\" came about in commit 3858fd3764016e567f752fa1b6df750ed558e71d, at which time it could throw:\n\n``` HTML\n<p>Other nodes types (e.g. <code title=\"\">Attr</code>) cannot occur as\nchildren of elements. If they do, this algorithm must raise an\n<code>INVALID_STATE_ERR</code> exception.</p>\n```\n\nThis was eventually commented out in commit 92191604e22d72baf0495086891254ce827f4ecb and still remains, so the commented out bits should also be removed. I'll take care of that and merge.\n",
